diff --git a/expat/Changes b/expat/Changes
index 7c41a4fc038b37e813f362b02f91b5ae006d2864..0ffac7c70abd9c95d0a99021c066ac87c3a0f978 100644
--- a/expat/Changes
+++ b/expat/Changes
@@ -17,7 +17,15 @@
 !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
 
 Release 2.8.3 XXX XXX XX XXXX
+        Security fixes:
+           #1296  CVE-2026-72522 -- Fix an out-of-bounds read caused by
+                    mis-classifying low surrogates (Unicode) as high
+                    surrogates in functions `*_toUtf16`.
+                    Needs Expat compiled with 16bit character support
+                    (e.g. with Firefox and/or on Windows) to be affected.
+
         Special thanks to:
+            Henri Sivonen
             City of Munich Open Source Sabbatical
 
 
